STEP 2 — API CLIENT

File: src/api/client.js

Create an Axios instance:
- baseURL: http://localhost:8000/api
- On every request, read token from localStorage key "access_token" and attach as Authorization: Bearer <token> header
- On 401 response, clear localStorage and redirect to /login
- Export named functions for every API call:

AUTH:
  register(data) → POST /auth/register/
  login(data) → POST /auth/login/ → store access_token and refresh_token in localStorage
  getProfile() → GET /auth/me/
  updateProfile(data) → PATCH /auth/me/

EVENT TYPES:
  getEventTypes() → GET /events/event-types/
  createEventType(data) → POST /events/event-types/
  updateEventType(id, data) → PATCH /events/event-types/<id>/
  deleteEventType(id) → DELETE /events/event-types/<id>/
  getPublicEventTypes(username) → GET /events/public/<username>/event-types/
  getSlots(username, eventTypeId, date) → GET /events/public/<username>/event-types/<id>/slots/?date=<date>

AVAILABILITY:
  getAvailability() → GET /events/availability/
  createAvailability(data) → POST /events/availability/
  updateAvailability(id, data) → PATCH /events/availability/<id>/
  deleteAvailability(id) → DELETE /events/availability/<id>/

BOOKINGS:
  createBooking(data) → POST /bookings/
  getMyBookings(status) → GET /bookings/my/?status=<status>
  cancelBooking(id, token) → POST /bookings/<id>/cancel/?token=<token>

PAYMENTS:
  createPaymentIntent(data) → POST /payments/create-intent/

INTEGRATIONS:
  getGoogleAuthUrl() → GET /integrations/google/auth/
  getGoogleStatus() → GET /integrations/google/status/
  disconnectGoogle() → DELETE /integrations/google/disconnect/

