STEP 3 — AUTH CONTEXT

File: src/context/AuthContext.jsx

Create a React context that:
- Stores user object and isAuthenticated boolean in state
- On mount, if access_token exists in localStorage, calls getProfile() and sets user
- Provides login(credentials), logout(), register(data) functions
- logout() clears localStorage and redirects to /login
- Wrap the entire app in this provider

