STEP 4 — ROUTING

File: src/App.jsx

Set up React Router with these routes:

Public routes (no auth required):
  / → Home
  /login → Login
  /register → Register
  /book/:username → BookingPage (lists all event types for that host)
  /book/:username/:slug → BookingPage (specific event type with slot picker)
  /booking-confirmed → BookingConfirmed

Protected routes (redirect to /login if not authenticated):
  /dashboard → Dashboard
  /event-types → EventTypes
  /event-types/new → CreateEventType
  /availability → Availability
  /settings → Settings

ProtectedRoute component checks AuthContext.isAuthenticated. If false, redirect to /login.

